  <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0;">SVG ELECTRIC & CONTROL PRODUCTS</p>
  <h1 class="title">BUSINESS REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (BRD)</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">Estimation & Product Management System (Version 2.0 - Streamlined Scope)</div>
</div>

<div class="card-meta">
  <table style="border: none; margin: 0;">
