    <tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none; font-weight: bold; padding: 3pt 0;">Target Roles:</td><td style="border: none; padding: 3pt 0;">1. System Administrator &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2. Technical Sales Engineer</td></tr>
